### 18. Atualizar Agendamento Inexistente (Deve retornar erro 404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "tipoServico": "INSTALACAO",
    "idVeiculo": 1,
    "idCliente": 1
}

### 19. Listar Agenda Ordenada por Data (Deve retornar a ordem: 05/10, 15/10 e 30/10)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 20. Testar Rota Protegida Sem Token (Deve retornar erro 401/403)
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos

### 21. Deletar cliente Inexistente (Deve retornar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/999
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 22. Deletar cliente 3 (Roberto)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cliente/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}